paperweight-skel (0.2.1-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Add cava waybar visualizer module.
    ~/.config/cava/waybar-config: 10 bars, 30fps, raw 8-bit output via pulse.
    ~/.local/bin/cava-waybar: Python3 script mapping cava frames to Unicode
    block characters and emitting waybar JSON.
    waybar/config.jsonc: custom/cava in modules-left after memory.
    macchiato-waybar.css: @teal pill with 11px font and 1px letter-spacing.

