paperweight-skel (0.2.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Add 40-workspaces.conf: workspace assignments and app-launch keybinds.
    $mod+[t/b/e/s/c/g] switches to workspace and launches app.
    $mod+Shift+[t/b/e/s] opens floating variant on current workspace.
    assign rules for firefox (ws2), discord/vesktop (ws5).
    MOZ_APP_REMOTINGNAME trick for floating Firefox with distinct app_id.
  * Remove $mod+c clipboard-clear binding; reassigned to chat (workspace 5).

